# generated outputs
# Scoped deliberately. Each rule is anchored to the repository root, where the
# README's example commands actually write, so an unanchored "results*/" or
# "legacy*/" cannot swallow a similarly named directory somewhere else in the
# tree.
/results/
/legacy/
/both/
examples/data/
examples/out_*/
*.tsv.gz

# development process record -- archived locally, never published
.superpowers/
docs/superpowers/
/STAGE*_STOP_REPORT.md

# working specs and stage reports -- never published
.process/
